// Starter template — Weekly / sprint retro

@cover Retro — <sprint or week>

@heading What went well
@sticky color=green
  ...

@heading What did not
@sticky color=coral
  ...

@heading What we will change
@decision title="One concrete change"
  context: ...
  choice: ...
  consequences: ...

@heading Action items
@table style=sketch
  Action, Owner, By when
  <what>, <who>, <when>
